+# Process audit — S5-CLM-00003503
+
+The worker claim is `S5THM-00003503-TARGET--worker` and owns only `S5THM-00003503-TARGET`.  The frozen record,
+source locator, Stage6 alias, and baseline digests are copied into `intake.json`.
+
+## Checklist
+
+- INTAKE: exact record and migration evidence bound.
+- STATEMENT: source definition and independent universe replay compile.
+- ANCHOR: pinned source anchor and local content digests recorded.
+- TREE: typed acyclic proof-unit graph with one readable anchor per node.
+- MACHINE: trust-zero local diagnostics compile; exact affine-plane root remains open.
+- READABLE: every frontier node has a delimited reconstruction fragment;
+  synthesized-proof coverage and identity-distinct review remain open.
+- VALIDATE: cold temporary-project replay, forbidden-token scan, JSON seal audit,
+  and claim self-check all pass.
+- RELEASE: provisional nonacceptance handoff awaits the missing proof and then
+  canonical Master review.
+
+The provider proof body is not imported.  No canonical checkout, Blueprint,
+catalog, or second mathematical ID was written; no collaboration tool or
+claim-specific axiom was used.
